{"updated":"2026-10-27T21:07:52.875Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"De_1v2Ek9Hk","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De_1v2Ek9Hk","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"它不只是一般的 AI 聊天機器人，而是一套完整的 AI 個人學習平台。\n\n可以匯入 PDF、文件或影片建立知識庫，讓 AI 根據教材回答問題，還能自動產生測驗、規劃學習路線、追蹤學習進度，甚至把複雜概念轉成互動式視覺化內容。\n\n最有趣的是，它整合了 RAG、多 Agent、記憶系統與個人化教學流程，而且支援 Docker 自架。\n\n所以拿來準備證照或學習新技術感覺超級適合\n\n例如把教材、技術文件和題庫匯入 DeepTutor，讓 AI 幫忙規劃每天的學習內容，針對答錯的觀念出新題，再用圖解說明整個架構。\n\n感覺可以把原本散落在各處的學習資源，直接變成一所自己的 AI 學校","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:18:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_1vxRk-Cs","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De_1vxRk-Cs","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/HKUDS…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:18:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-pOgzE-dQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De-pOgzE-dQ","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"專案叫做 ziwei-doushu，目前 GitHub 已經有超過 8,100 Stars。\n\n它不是單純的算命網站，而是一套基於倪海廈《天紀》體系的紫微斗數排盤引擎。\n\n🔹 67.5 萬張命盤\n🔹 877 萬段解讀內容\n🔹 涵蓋事業、財運、感情等 13 個面向\n🔹 解壓後資料量達 56.6 GB\n\n而且排盤演算法使用 TypeScript 開發，程式碼採 MIT 授權，資料集也提供開放授權。\n\n所以拿來研究傳統命理的數位化感覺很適合\n\n例如用 Codex 打造一個互動式紫微斗數網站，輸入出生資料後，自動產生命盤，再串接 LLM，把複雜的星曜與宮位轉換成容易理解的互動式說明。\n\n甚至可以做成 RPG 風格的「人生角色面板」，把十二宮、星曜、四化變成遊戲化的視覺介面 😂\n\n當然，命理解讀屬於傳統文化觀點，不等於科學預測。\n\n但從工程角度來看，把傳統知識轉成演算法與結構化資料，真的蠻有意思的。","timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:09:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":3},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-pO-Hk_z2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De-pO-Hk_z2","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/Renhu…\n\n線上體驗：\nmetisziwei.com","timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:09:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De9TZ5XAOl1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De9TZ5XAOl1","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"最酷的是，它的動作可以透過強化學習訓練，而不是只能執行寫死的動作。\n開發者可以先在 MuJoCo 模擬環境訓練，再把學到的動作部署到真正的機器鴨身上。\n\n所以拿來研究實體 AI 感覺超級適合的\n\n例如用 Codex 協助設計一個迷你機器鴨足球場，讓小鴨學習走位、踢球、跌倒後重新站起來，甚至挑戰自己完成一場足球比賽。\n\n感覺以後不只是 AI 幫我們寫程式，連機器寵物的動作都能自己訓練了 😂\n\n而且整套控制軟體都是開源的！\n\n你會想訓練這隻小鴨做什麼？🦆","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:40:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De9TeChE-Pz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De9TeChE-Pz","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：pollen-robotics/microduck\ngithub.com/polle…","timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:40:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De75BOTk01O","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De75BOTk01O","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"終於幫Grok Bot蓋好大樓了\n越來越像一家公司了","timestamp":"2026-10-25T23:29:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfABdGBgKgS","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfABdGBgKgS","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家萬聖節都扮過什麼啊？\n我需要休學之外的選項。\n\n亞洲大學卡友扮這個，明顯是個狠人","timestamp":"2026-10-27T14:00:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":30,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":36,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfABefGAJPc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfABefGAJPc","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自➡️萬聖節大家開心🥳亞洲還是有人材的⬅️\n搜尋