"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De_zrfSAV2g","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"老婆想囤肯瓊醬\n理科男原PO直接算「每盒醬成本」\n\n單點4塊雞塊給一盒醬，等於得到一盒醬要花 $49\n單點6塊雞塊還是只有一盒，一盒醬 $64\n單點10塊雞塊有兩盒，平均一盒醬 $52\n20塊分享餐，四盒醬，平均一盒醬 $49.75\n30塊分享餐，六盒醬，平均一盒醬 $48.16\n1+1 選4塊雞塊 也是一盒醬 $50\n\n照原PO當時的算法 最後選了30塊分享餐\n花了$1,445\n帶回30盒醬150塊雞塊和5包大薯\n\n好奇大家會被這樣的行為暖到嗎？","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:00:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_ztMkgews","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/De_ztMkgews","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"暖你一整天還是飽你一整天？\n\n原文來自➡️理科男的浪漫⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多理工男的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:00:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"De_3qtvFHll","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De_3qtvFHll","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"巨大機器人守台北，打壞大樓卻要賠錢！台灣開發者製作《機甲大戰－台北》，網頁就能玩戰役、無盡與對戰，還得兼顧十二區戰況與機體升級。目前是開發中測試版，玩法與操作怎麼上手？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:35:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_3xTklLEN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De_3xTklLEN","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:36:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_jTfslDBP","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De_jTfslDBP","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Windows 11 26H2 更新推送擴大，24H2、25H2 使用者可到 Windows Update 查看；實際是否收到仍看裝置狀態。輕量更新背後不只換版本號，支援週期也值得注意。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:37:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_jUC8lBhF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De_jUC8lBhF","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:37:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_OQYlFFZr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De_OQYlFFZr","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Affinity 新版 iPad App 把修圖、向量、排版與草圖整合在一起，預計11月3日推出。個人核心工具免費，部分 AI 則需付費方案；舊版檔案與跨平台工作流怎麼銜接？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-27T06:33:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_Odf9FKwe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De_Odf9FKwe","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T06:35:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-6LTFk73j","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De-6LTFk73j","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"GPT-6.1 Terra 來了！Max 在第三方綜合評測拿到 48 分，與 Sol Medium 同分，電腦操作和視覺理解也有升級。不過 API 單價與每項任務成本是兩回事，怎麼選才合適？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:37:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-6L8XE6kD","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/De-6L8XE6kD","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:37:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"De_lF4JD3DQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De_lF4JD3DQ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"業務開發常常需要找客戶名單\n\nTreg 利用本身串接多種資料來源\n加上 Jev 做便宜快速的篩選\n\n讓你只需要花 1.49 美金 ( 不到 50 元台幣 )\n就能找到 96 筆名單\n換算一筆名單花費不到 1 塊台幣","timestamp":"2026-10-27T09:56:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":38,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":26},"score":40,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_No-pEd-E","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De_No-pEd-E","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"詐騙猖獗\n目前推測這帳號高機率不是本人\n晚點應該就會推薦股票或是說有 line 群了！","timestamp":"2026-10-27T06:27:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":21,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":31,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De9dSDLn7PU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De9dSDLn7PU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"使喚 Grok Bot 的 n 種方法\n\n好不容易花了 30 美金以上\n卻只有用 Grok Bot App 嗎？\n\n其實你還有很多種方法可以使喚它\n只要串個 Cloudflare 或類似服務\n甚至還能直接串到你的 Line OA\n\n一個最簡單 Line AI 客服可能就上線了\n(但你得做好很多準備才對，不是這樣串一串就開放使用)\n\n各種串接的方法超簡單\n有興趣歡迎留言\n再提供教學給大家","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:06:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":81,"replies":6,"reposts":10,"shares":54},"score":123,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-03XVn1uN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De-03XVn1uN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"文章連結：\nshort.darrelltw.com/grok…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:51:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De8vl-9ETyn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De8vl-9ETyn","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"突然覺得挺有趣的\nAI 現在已經算蠻強了\n\n但當截圖軟體問我要不要續約一年的時候\n我還是會想要同意\n而不是想要自己做一個\n\n到底是因為它太便宜\n還是我覺得還做不出一個更好用的","timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:26:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":9,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":38,"first_seen":"2026-10-28T01:20:44+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@i